          "body": "For ordinary public journal access, MCA 1-5-618(6)(a) calls for a signed tangible or electronic request specifying the month, year, record type and principal. A request to browse all transactions involving an office should be evaluated against those specificity conditions rather than treated automatically as a right to the entire book."
